title: The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> joins the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span>
subtitle: Lambach forces the party into the front.
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and nationalists_staal >= 8 and gnu_formed and traditionalist_leader == "Lambach"
